Site: IC Clean — professional cleaning service website
Client: IC Clean, Greater Toronto Area
Location: Richmond Hill, Newmarket and surrounding GTA areas
Tone: plain-spoken, personal, honest. No jargon. No corporate language.
Tagline: No Diplomas. No Jargon. Just a Clean Home.

Services: House/Condo Cleaning, Deep Cleaning, Move In/Out, Post-Renovation
Audience: homeowners, property managers, management companies, realtors

Stack: Hugo extended, vanilla CSS, no JS frameworks
Theme: hugo-story (HTML5 UP Story port) — one-page, data-driven via /data/ YAML files
Hugo version: 0.161.1 extended

Differentiators:
- Small personal team, not a corporation
- HEPA-filter vacuums
- Walk-through inspection at end of every clean
- Fully insured, certificate available on request
- Pricing: $35/hr per person (initial), $40/hr deep/move/reno
- No hidden fees, no minimum hours

All version control uses jj, never git.
